# Phase 2.3 — ToneProfile Profile Bundle on World Seed (Execution)

Execution secondary for session-0 ToneProfileBundle attachment on SeedBundle, ArchetypeRegistry, ProfileWeightManifest inject, ToneCompatibilityGate, and ToneFallbackResolver. Parallel spine under `Roadmap/Execution/Phase-2-…/Phase-2-3-…/`. **No Half B code. No L5 / factory.**

